    "checked": "2026-10-01",
    "confidence": "low",
    "notes": "No publisher's page is reproduced. Write the lines of each poem as verse; stanzas are verses one after the other. Headings of the first level are the poems, each on a page of its own; of the second, the parts of a long poem."
